{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297923","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297923","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1029792301:1":{"text":"今日も護衛お疲れ様だね！さ、熱いスープでも飲んで！","source_cn":"今天也辛苦你护送旅客了，来，喝碗热汤！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC43A9DFD94DA2C67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029792302:1":{"text":"果物はいるかい？それともパンがいい？ウチが燻したベーコンも――","source_cn":"水果要不要？还是面包？或者我亲自熏的火腿——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x137A92F12CEC9535","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029792303:1":{"text":"ありがとう。スープで十分だ。おかげで体が温まったよ。","source_cn":"不，多谢，我喝口汤暖暖身子就可以了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D9FC8F4EBF546CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029792304:1":{"text":"食べ過ぎると、体の動きや思考が鈍くなってしまうからな。","source_cn":"吃太多会影响身体灵活，脑子也会变迟钝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FD347ABAE194E78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029792305:1":{"text":"今日の仕事はもう終わったんだろう？なら、ゆっくり美味しいものでも食べればいいのに。","source_cn":"但今天的工作已经完成了，你就应该坐下来好好吃点东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA844615EF1AC557F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029792306:1":{"text":"そんで温泉に浸かって、ぐっすり寝れば、明日も元気百倍だべ！","source_cn":"泡个温泉，睡一觉，第二天又是精神百倍！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAAED8CAB692D5ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029792307:1":{"text":"ありがたいが、温泉に入ると乾かすのが面倒でな……","source_cn":"不，多谢了，泡温泉要晾干实在太花时间了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD5058415B6A18CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029792308:1":{"text":"雪で体を擦ればきれいになるし、頭もスッキリする。","source_cn":"我用雪稍微擦擦就足够干净，也能提神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2BD6513E9A26B44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029792309:1":{"text":"どんだけストイックなんだい！だめだ、せめて今日ぐらいはたらふく食べてもらうからね！","source_cn":"你过得也太艰苦了！不行，今天必须坐下来，好好吃一顿大餐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32F68C9A041EB568","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029792310:1":{"text":"わ、分かった。ならお言葉に甘えるとしよう。","source_cn":"那……那就多谢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F6CFC3C8E1F5761","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格尔达":{"text":"ガルダ","source":"格尔达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:法拉莫尔":{"text":"フェルガルド","source":"法拉莫尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":2}}